  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0\n      \n      Features:\n      - SHA-256 hashing with uppercase hexadecimal output.\n      - Constant-time hash verification.\n      - AES-GCM authenticated encryption and decryption.\n      - Support for AES-128, AES-192, and AES-256.\n      - Random 12-byte nonces and 16-byte authentication tags.\n      - Versioned, Base64-encoded encrypted payloads.\n      - No third-party dependencies.",
